{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE GIANT HOLE</strong><br><strong>Humanity teams up to dig BILLIONS of VOXELS to create the world\u2019s biggest hole\u2014together.</strong> <br><strong>Every swing makes this giant hole bigger!</strong>    <br><strong>Chat with others while mining via a Twitter-like feed.</strong>    <br><strong>Dig this giant hole with friends, strangers, or solo! </strong>   <br> <strong>What\u2019s at the bottom? Nobody knows\u2026 yet.</strong>    </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Giant Hole</strong> \u2013 millions of players digging the same GIANT HOLE together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Worldwide Progression</strong> \u2013 dig billions of voxels, reveal new layers, and reach the bottom, together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twitter-Like Feed</strong> - socialize with others globally while mining via a twitter-like messages feed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rare Resources &amp; Upgrades\u00a0</strong>\u2013 digging gives you resources, some common, some rare. Sell them for upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join friends, strangers, or play solo\u00a0</strong>- proximity voice chat and text chat available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When the bottom is reached</strong>, no one will expect what will happen next. This is only the start.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's at the bottom of this ONE GIANT HOLE?</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4076980?t=1760051123","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076980/9f17d14269c76541a5db14cf7ff8255df1523ded/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760051123","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076980/f17c6f1ba888164418afc0e88a38b4d2d455eb72/capsule_231x87